  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 286b4216db884fc198cab5d296bbc9cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Note
  title: Ankieta klienta
  text: "ANKIETA KLIENTA\n\nJak oceniasz swoj\u0105 wizyt\u0119?   1/5\n\nUwagi: Nie mog\u0119 znale\u017A\u0107 wyj\u015Bcia. Krzes\u0142a s\u0105 za du\u017Ce. Sto\u0142y wisz\u0105 pod sufitem.\nKto\u015B w naszej czapce stoi za lad\u0105 od tygodnia i si\u0119 nie rusza.\nKiedy si\u0119 odwracam \u2013 stoi bli\u017Cej."
  titleEn: Customer survey
  textEn: "CUSTOMER SURVEY\n\nHow would you rate your visit?   1/5\n\nComments: I can't find the exit. The chairs are too big. The tables hang from the ceiling.\nSomeone in our cap has been standing behind the counter for a week and doesn't move.\nWhen I turn around \u2013 he's standing closer."
  paper: {fileID: 273295522}
