--- !u!114 &1073719067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1073719065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 286b4216db884fc198cab5d296bbc9cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Note
  title: Notatka kierownika zmiany
  text: "Do wszystkich zmian:\n\nCo\u015B chodzi w rurach pod sufitem. Najpierw s\u0142ycha\u0107 stukanie,\nrury dr\u017C\u0105, z po\u0142\u0105cze\u0144 sypie si\u0119 kurz. Kiedy kurz leci \u2013 NIE RUSZAJ SI\u0118.\n\nCzasem czeka nad w\u0142azem. S\u0142ycha\u0107 wtedy ciche mruczenie i z rury kapie.\nNIE PRZECHOD\u0179 POD SPODEM.\n\nGa\u015Bnica je odstrasza. Widzia\u0142em, jak uciek\u0142o do rury.\nAle wraca. Zawsze wraca tam, gdzie ostatnio s\u0142ysza\u0142o ludzi.\n\n\u2013 kierownik zmiany"
  titleEn: Shift manager's memo
  textEn: "To all shifts:\n\nSomething walks in the pipes under the ceiling. First you hear knocking,\nthe pipes shake, dust falls from the joints. When the dust falls \u2013 DON'T MOVE.\n\nSometimes it waits above a hatch. You can hear a quiet purring, and the pipe drips.\nDON'T WALK UNDERNEATH.\n\nThe extinguisher scares it off. I saw it flee into a pipe.\nBut it comes back. It always comes back to where it last heard people.\n\n\u2013 shift manager"
  paper: {fileID: 2117179231}
